Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Why is the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:00.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,end of this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.99,0:00:01.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,runway built
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.79,0:00:02.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,to crumble?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.58,0:00:03.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sometimes a jet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.34,0:00:04.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,can't stop and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:04.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,runs off
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.71,0:00:05.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.45,0:00:06.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,So many airports
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.47,0:00:06.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,add a bed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.93,0:00:07.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,of crushable
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.56,0:00:08.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,concrete blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.86,0:00:09.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,It looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.32,0:00:10.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,pavement, but it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.43,0:00:11.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,light and full
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.39,0:00:12.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,of bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.29,0:00:12.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Under the weight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:13.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,of a plane,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:14.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,the blocks crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.01,0:00:15.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,The tires sink
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:16.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,in, like driving
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:17.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,into deep sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.17,0:00:18.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every block they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:19.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,crush takes away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.89,0:00:20.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,some of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.15,0:00:20.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,the speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:21.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's built to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.39,0:00:22.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,stop a jet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.11,0:00:23.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,rolling in at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.17,0:00:23.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,eighty miles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.77,0:00:24.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:25.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,It has already
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:26.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,stopped more than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:27.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,two dozen planes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.47,0:00:28.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,with hundreds aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:30.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Afterward, crews just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.14,0:00:30.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,replace the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.66,0:00:31.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,crushed blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.82,0:00:32.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's the gray
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.45,0:00:33.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,pad at the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.09,0:00:33.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,end of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:34.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,some runways.
